    "text": "A particle of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;is suspended from a ceiling through a string of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math>. The particle moves in a horizontal circle of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>. The speed (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>) of the particle and the tension (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>) in the string is",
